 * semantics (free-form children, `CommandEmpty`, a controlled search value,
 * value-based `onSelect`, `shouldFilter`), which the React Aria shadcn
 * `command` (an `Autocomplete` over a `Menu` collection) does not offer. This
 * build keeps cmdk (headless; it bundles a few Radix packages internally)
